**Status:** DRAFT — Codex-Astra reviewed 2026-09-29 (verdict: REJECT, 14 findings; all addressed
in this revision — see §12). Pending Sandeep's FINAL APPROVAL.
**Gate (explicit):** NO v3 training starts before Sandeep's final approval. This document may not
authorize training on its own.
**Date:** 2026-09-29 (rev 2). Author: Ronin (supervisor draft).
**Predecessors:** SPEC-V2, MIXTURE-V2, DATASET-V2, VERDICT-v2 (all under
`/home/clawer-samurai-1/AgentHub/cyberguard/docs/`). v2 contract loop terminated by owner order
2026-09-29 ~18:38 CDT; VERDICT-v2 committed (Arm A frozen NO-SHIP / Arm B SHIP).
